  "claim": "The star of the 2013 romantic/comedy film Oldboy was cast as a Marvel Comics character. He was cast as Cable in the film series in which Shawn Ashmore is known for the dual role of Bobby Drake/Iceman.",
  "evidencia": "Page: Josh Brolin. Sentence: In April 2017, Brolin was cast as Nathan Summers / Cable as a part of a four-film contract in the \"X-Men\" film series, with his first appearance intended to be in \"Deadpool 2\".\nPage: Cable (comics). Sentence: Cable (Nathan Summers) is a fictional character appearing in American comic books published by Marvel Comics, commonly in association with X-Force and the X-Men.\nPage: Oldboy (2013 film). Sentence: It was directed by Spike Lee and written by Mark Protosevich, the film stars Josh Brolin, Elizabeth Olsen and Sharlto Copley.\nPage: Shawn Ashmore. Sentence: He is known for his roles as Jake in the television series \"Animorphs\", Agent Mike Weston in the television drama series \"The Following\", and Bobby Drake/Iceman in the \"X-Men\" film series.",
