        "original_id": "10e60577-b54d-56a6-804b-1997ab8f9088",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Josh Brolin, Shawn Ashmore, Spike Lee, Mark Protosevich, Elizabeth Olsen, Sharlto Copley\n- Characters: Nathan Summers, Cable, Bobby Drake, Iceman, Jake, Agent Mike Weston\n- Franchises and Series: X-Men, X-Force, Deadpool 2, Animorphs, The Following\n- Works: Oldboy (2013 film)\n- Companies: Marvel Comics\n\nFacts:\n- Cable, also known as Nathan Summers, is a fictional character in American comic books published by Marvel Comics and commonly associated with X-Force and the X-Men.\n- Oldboy (2013 film) was directed by Spike Lee, written by Mark Protosevich, and starred Josh Brolin, Elizabeth Olsen, and Sharlto Copley.\n- In April 2017, Josh Brolin was cast as Nathan Summers / Cable in the X-Men film series under a four-film contract, with his first appearance intended for Deadpool 2.\n- Shawn Ashmore is known for playing Jake in Animorphs, Agent Mike Weston in The Following, and Bobby Drake / Iceman in the X-Men film series.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
